.Dd September 22, 2026
.Dt RMUSER 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rmuser
.Nd remove a user interactively
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl y
.Ar username ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
shows each named directory user's record, asks whether to remove the user
and whether to remove the home under
.Pa /Local/Users
as well, and does so with
.Xr dscli 8 .
The user is dropped from every group and their private group goes with
them.
.Pp
.Fl y
skips the questions and removes the user and the home.
.Pp
System accounts are not touched;
.Nm
says to use
.Xr pw 8
for them.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr adduser 8 ,
.Xr dscli 8 ,
.Xr pw 8
